// Title: Execute Files with Msdeploy.exe
// Rule ID: 646bc99f-6682-4b47-a73a-17b1b64c9d34
// Severity: medium
// Tags: attack.defense-evasion, attack.t1218
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
